      {
        "nav": "继续复原藏品",
        "byte_start": 133791,
        "byte_end": 134705,
        "span_sha256": "de85dec5a1853d53bd94e9f0ae360b61577deab6e5b0d21b695ee173e1f8446d",
        "text": "<div class=\"scene\" data-nav=\"继续复原藏品\" data-image=\"Avg_pic_rogue_6_24\" data-name=\"回滚文明\" data-ename=\"\" data-index=\"137\" data-prtsinfo=\"\"><div class=\"sceneText\" style=\"display:none;\">“看得出来，你对于这种转换并不信任。”它眯起眼睛，似乎看穿了你的想法，“我在这座理想的实验场中，已经探索出了许多种方法来重组物质的信息单元。只要你提供素材来赞助我的实验，我可以为你逐一演示。”\n</div><div class=\"choose\" data-type=\"simple\" data-title=\"继续赞助它\" data-icon=\"sacrifice\" data-dest=\"4\" data-iconid=\"\" data-subchoose=\"\"><div class=\"desc1\" style=\"display:none;\">看看还能有什么把戏</div></div>\n<div class=\"choose\" data-type=\"simple\" data-title=\"有点可疑\" data-icon=\"leave\" data-dest=\"5\" data-iconid=\"\" data-subchoose=\"\"><div class=\"desc1\" style=\"display:none;\">见好就收</div></div></div>\n"
      },
      {
        "nav": "继续复原零件",
        "byte_start": 137323,
        "byte_end": 138243,
        "span_sha256": "eacc861082f05669e10a78ee050c1b2ab04339340c1e1d5d917d91e5a6820ffe",
